--   **The cost of the general procedure against the structural cost.**
--
--   The following holds (Lean statement, in the scope of module `Solutions.R6ILCostR`):
--
--   ```lean
--   theorem IntMul.Kappa.R6.IL.costN_real (C : Bit.QHNet (ZMod 2) W T m) (q Bb : ℕ) (hm : 2 ≤ m) (hruns : C.RunsOK) :
--       ∀ e, 1 ≤ e → ∀ V : ℕ, (costN C q Bb e V : ℝ) ≤
--         (2 * cq q + Kv C : ℝ) * ((V : ℝ) * Bit.cH C e) + (KA C q : ℝ) * ovN C e * ((Bb : ℝ) + 2) ^ 2
--   ```
--
--   **Context.** Round six, item language: the cost of the general procedure against `costH`
--
--   `costN_real`: `costN e V ≤ (2 cq + Kv) · V · cH e + KA · ovN e · (Bb + 2)²` for `e ≥ 1`, where
--   `ovN` counts `(e + 1)` per node of the call tree; `ovN_le`: `ovN e ≤ (e + 1) (S + 1) ^ depH e`.
